  "supportFollowUs": "FOLLOW US",
  "supportFaq1Q": "How do I post a task?",
  "supportFaq1A": "Tap the \"+\" button below, fill in the task details like category, location, and price offer. Then submit and wait for a runner to pick up your task.",
  "supportFaq2Q": "How do I become a Runner?",
  "supportFaq2A": "Switch your role to \"Runner\" from your profile. You can then find available tasks in the feed and accept suitable ones.",
  "supportFaq3Q": "How does payment work?",
  "supportFaq3A": "Payment is made directly between the Customer and Runner after task completion. We recommend using DuitNow or bank transfer.",
  "supportFaq4Q": "Can I cancel a task?",
  "supportFaq4A": "Yes, you can cancel from the \"My Tasks\" page as long as no runner has accepted it yet.",
  "supportFaq5Q": "What if the runner doesn't show up?",
  "supportFaq5A": "Contact us through \"Contact Us\" and we will help resolve the issue within 24 hours.",
  "supportFaq6Q": "Can Ngam runners be trusted?",
  "supportFaq6A": "All our runners must go through a strict identity verification process before their accounts are activated for your safety.",
  "supportFaq7Q": "Can I communicate with the runner?",
  "supportFaq7A": "Yes, you can use the in-app chat to communicate with the runner once they accept your task.",
  "supportFaq8Q": "What if the item price changes?",
  "supportFaq8A": "You can discuss with the runner through chat. The runner will inform you of the actual price with a receipt for verification.",
  "supportFaq9Q": "How do I give a rating?",
  "supportFaq9A": "After the task is marked as complete, a pop-up will appear allowing you to rate and review the runner.",
  "supportFaq10Q": "Is my location information safe?",
  "supportFaq10A": "Yes, your personal and exact location information will only be shared with the runner who has accepted your task.",
  "supportFaq11Q": "How long does it take to complete a task?",
  "supportFaq11A": "It depends on the type of task and distance. You can view the estimated time or ask the runner directly.",
  "supportFaq12Q": "What if my item is damaged?",
  "supportFaq12A": "Please take a photo of the damage and contact our customer support within 24 hours for compensation assistance.",
  "supportFaq13Q": "Can I tip the runner?",
  "supportFaq13A": "Of course! You can give a cash tip directly to the runner or include the tip amount in your original task price offer.",
  "supportFaq14Q": "Is there a weight limit for items?",
  "supportFaq14A": "We recommend a maximum weight of 15kg for motorcycle delivery tasks. For larger items, please state clearly in the description.",
  "supportFaq15Q": "Can I change location after runner accepts?",
  "supportFaq15A": "Location changes after task acceptance are subject to runner agreement. Additional costs may apply.",
